{
  "title": "FXFunds — Risk Disclosure Bot",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "FXFunds Risk Disclosure Bot tells you how much risk, as a percentage, a trade or a USDT transfer carries at the moment you check it. It weighs leverage, position size, stop loss, volatility and current market timing (weekends, closed markets, rollover hours, news) and returns a 0–100% risk figure with a level and explanation. Transfer checks cover network mismatch, address format, missing memo and first-time addresses. A single risk database links eight risk categories to FAQ keywords, plain answers, examples and the related FXFunds FAQs, searchable by keyword. Offline Node.js and Python library with a CLI and one CSV dataset.",
